    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        StyleDrive: Towards Driving-Style Aware Benchmarking of End-To-End Autonomous Driving
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hao%2C+R">Ruiyang Hao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jing%2C+B">Bowen Jing</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+H">Haibao Yu</a>, 
      
